      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u00b7 GPU path traverses 4 bridges (GPP \u2192 PEX upstream \u2192 PEX downstream \u2192 AMD 1500 \u2192 AMD 1501 \u2192 MI325X)",
      "originalText": "\u00b7 GPU path traverses 4 bridges (GPP \u2192 PEX upstream \u2192 PEX downstream \u2192 AMD 1500 \u2192 AMD 1501 \u2192 MI325X)",
